            <ArticleTitle>[Postoperative pain management using elastomeric pumps].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>46-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Elastomeric infusions pumps are single use devices that permit continuous drugs infusion in a safe and simple way. They help to maintain drugs plasma level stability and analgesia in order to control acute pain and improves patients quality of life, which are an effective alternative for de treatment of pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
